{
  "tema": 7058,
  "slug": "me-encanta",
  "titulo": "To love something or doing something: encantar",
  "subtitulo": "Me encanta surfear.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "To say you love a thing or an activity, use encantar, built like gustar: me encanta el mar, me encantan los tacos, me encanta surfear. Keep querer and amar for people.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Encantar** works exactly like **gustar**, only stronger: the thing you love is the subject, and you are the pronoun."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "me / te / le / nos / les",
            "+ encanta(n) +",
            "thing or infinitive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "What you love",
            "Verb",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "one thing",
              "encanta",
              "Me encanta el mar."
            ],
            [
              "several things",
              "encantan",
              "Me encantan las tortillas de harina."
            ],
            [
              "an activity",
              "encanta",
              "Me encanta surfear."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With infinitives, always **encanta**: **Nos encanta** bailar y cantar."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Querer** and **amar** are for people: **Te quiero**, **amo a mi familia**. For things and activities, **encantar** is the natural choice."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **encantar** = _to enchant_. The tacos enchant you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Me encanta== el olor del mar.",
              "en": "I love the smell of the sea."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Me encantan== los tacos de pescado.",
              "en": "I love fish tacos."
            },
            {
              "es": "A mi hermana ==le encanta== bailar.",
              "en": "My sister loves dancing."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Nos encanta== trabajar en el huerto los domingos.",
              "en": "We love working in the garden on Sundays."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Te encantan== las películas de ciencia ficción?",
              "en": "Do you love sci-fi movies?"
            },
            {
              "es": "A mis amigos ==les encanta== entrenar juntos.",
              "en": "My friends love training together."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Me encanta== leer en la playa.",
              "en": "I love reading at the beach."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Yo encanto el surf."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Me encanta el surf."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Like **gustar**: pronoun + **encanta**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Me encanta los tacos."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Me encantan los tacos."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Plural thing: **encantan**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Me encantan surfear y nadar."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Me encanta surfear y nadar."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Infinitives: singular."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Quiero el mole."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Me encanta el mole."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "For _I love mole_: **encantar**. **Quiero el mole** = _I want the mole_."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
